# With completed hidden, completing a dated project in Today removes it and its dated children from the view.
file <<END
Move: @due({today})
	- Pack @due({today})
- Other @start({today})
END
keys gc gt
see - Pack  Move
keys x
hide Move:
hide Pack
see ▌ - Other
quit
saved <<END
Move: @due({today}) @done({today})
	- Pack @due({today})
- Other @start({today})
END
